"Change %lld commit messages?" = "要更改 %lld 条提交信息吗？";
"Change Messages" = "更改信息";
"Change this commit's message" = "更改此提交的信息";
"Commit Messages" = "提交信息";
"Commit Messages — %@" = "提交信息 — %@";
"Commits not pushed yet" = "尚未推送的提交";
"Edit Commit Messages…" = "编辑提交信息…";
"Edit messages…" = "编辑多条信息…";
"Edit message…" = "编辑信息…";
"Files and the working tree are not touched. The old commits are kept, so this can be undone." = "文件和工作副本不受影响。旧提交会保留，因此可以撤销。";
"Find and replace in messages…" = "在信息中查找并替换…";
"Find secrets…" = "查找机密…";
"Find:" = "查找：";
"For a secret in a message: the backup is deleted, so the rewrite can no longer be undone; reflog entries that no branch reaches any more go too (commits left behind by a reset among them, stashes excepted); then git prunes." = "针对信息中的机密：备份会被删除，因此改写将无法再撤销；任何分支都已无法到达的 reflog 条目也会删除（包括 reset 遗留的提交，储藏除外）；然后 git 执行清理（prune）。";
"Force-push" = "强制推送";
"Force-push %@?" = "要强制推送 %@ 吗？";
"Force-push the rewritten branches first; then remove again." = "请先强制推送改写后的分支；然后再次移除。";
"Force-push…" = "强制推送…";
"Git stored a commit under a different name than expected. No branch was moved." = "Git 以与预期不同的名称存储了提交。未移动任何分支。";
"In:" = "范围：";
"Leave as it is" = "保持原样";
"Leave this message as it is" = "保持此信息原样";
"Looks for tokens, keys and passwords in the listed messages" = "在列出的信息中查找令牌、密钥和密码";
"Match case" = "区分大小写";
"Move these onto the new commits:" = "将这些移到新提交上：";
"No known kind of token, key or password was found in these messages. Search for it by its text instead." = "在这些信息中未发现已知类型的令牌、密钥或密码。请改为按其文本搜索。";
"None of these commits is on a chosen branch or tag, so nothing was changed." = "这些提交都不在所选分支或标签上，因此未做任何更改。";
"None of these commits is on a local branch or tag, so there is nothing to rewrite here." = "这些提交都不在本地分支或标签上，因此这里没有可改写的内容。";
"Nothing changes yet. Find and replace, or type into the message below." = "尚未有任何更改。请查找并替换，或在下方的信息中输入。";
"Now" = "现在";
"Now — %@ by %@, %@" = "现在 — %1$@，作者 %2$@，%3$@";
"Reading the messages…" = "正在读取信息…";
"Redact" = "遮盖";
"Redact them" = "遮盖它们";
"Redacting fills in the search and the replacement; the list then shows what would change, and nothing is written before Apply." = "遮盖会填入搜索和替换内容；随后列表显示将会更改的内容，在“应用”之前不会写入任何内容。";
"Regular expression" = "正则表达式";
"Remove old commits…" = "移除旧提交…";
"Remove the old commits from this repository?" = "要从此仓库中移除旧提交吗？";
"Replace with %@" = "替换为 %@";
"Replace with (empty removes it)" = "替换为（留空则删除）";
"Replace:" = "替换：";
"Still reached from: %@." = "仍可从以下位置到达：%@。";
"Tag %@" = "标签 %@";
"Text to find in the messages" = "要在信息中查找的文本";
"The %lld changes:" = "%lld 处更改：";
"The %lld old commits are gone from this repository." = "%lld 个旧提交已从此仓库中删除。";
"The %lld selected commits" = "所选的 %lld 个提交";
"The branches and tags go back to the old commits — if none of them has moved since." = "分支和标签会回到旧提交 — 前提是它们此后都未移动。";
"The commit messages were last rewritten on %@. The old commits are kept so that it can be undone." = "提交信息上次改写于 %@。旧提交会保留，以便可以撤销。";
"The current branch" = "当前分支";
"The history could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "无法读取历史。未做任何更改。";
"The message of %@ is not stored as UTF-8 and cannot be changed here." = "%@ 的信息未以 UTF-8 存储，无法在此更改。";
"The message of %@ would be empty. A commit needs a message." = "%@ 的信息将为空。提交需要信息。";
"The regular expression is not valid." = "正则表达式无效。";
"The remote branches are replaced by the rewritten ones — with a lease: if somebody pushed to them since they were fetched, the push is refused instead." = "远程分支会被改写后的分支替换 — 使用 lease：如果自获取以来有人向其推送过，则会拒绝推送。";
"The selected commit" = "所选提交";
"There is no backup of that rewrite any more." = "该次改写的备份已不存在。";
"This is about this repository only. Commits that were pushed may still be reachable at the server — through pull requests, forks or caches — and in every clone. A secret that was pushed has to be revoked or changed." = "这仅涉及此仓库。已推送的提交可能仍可在服务器上到达 — 通过拉取请求、复刻或缓存 — 也可在每个克隆中到达。已推送的机密必须吊销或更改。";
"Undo" = "撤销";
"Undo the rewrite of the commit messages?" = "要撤销对提交信息的改写吗？";
"Undone: %@ are back on the old commits." = "已撤销：%@ 已回到旧提交上。";
"Was: %@" = "原为：%@";
"Whole words" = "全字匹配";
"edited" = "已编辑";
"in %lld commit(s)" = "在 %lld 个提交中";
"left as it is" = "已保持原样";
"pushed." = "已推送。";
"%@ still has the old commits. Force-push the rewritten branches first; removing the old commits before that would make the force-push impossible." = "%@ 仍包含旧提交。请先强制推送重写后的分支；在此之前移除旧提交会导致无法强制推送。";
"A fetch is running in this repository. Try again when it has finished." = "此仓库中正在进行 fetch。请在其完成后重试。";
"only the newest %lld commits are searched" = "仅搜索最新的 %lld 个提交";
